verdict: clean
scenario_results:
  - {scenario: 1, result: pass, notes: "name/description/tools/maxTurns are lines 2–5, before type/id/owner; confidence scheme now carried in-file with its governed source named; only actor-neutral seat language ('You hold the seat', 'Open it')."}
  - {scenario: 2, result: pass, notes: "No sentence says when the seat acts or what step precedes/follows; the escalation clause routes a case, it does not sequence it; storage location is an output property, not timing."}
